@Alexsuperfly marked this ready for review now (not sure if the `waiting for author` tag is meant to update automatically)

the reason I have drafts open is because of the repo rule of only 1 PR open at a time, and I have a bit of a backlog of updates to my plugins

Is there some better process around this for when I am waiting on review for an open PR but have updates ready for other plugins?

> The search is just local only, right? Is there a reason you need the RsnInputPolicy BLOCKED list?

@coopermor probably a little paranoid on my end. it's local only but the entered rsn string renders visibly in the plugin ui (search and player not found messages), so I wanted to add the rsn block list as a content safeguard that matched vanilla's hiscores, because currently the plugin could be used to render slurs or other abusive text and present screenshots that suggest it's Kill Clog's content.

Edit: It's pretty heinous having the hard list so I'll remove that and repin
